    "accessibility.title": "Accessibility statement",
    "accessibility.intro": "This statement covers the GTFS Express web application: the home page, the projects and their five steps, the explorer of a network, the share links and the information pages.",
    "accessibility.status.title": "Compliance status",
    "accessibility.status.nonCompliant": "Not compliant",
    "accessibility.status.partial": "Partially compliant",
    "accessibility.status.nonCompliant.body": "GTFS Express is not compliant with {referential} (the French general accessibility improvement framework): no compliance audit has been carried out yet, and without an audit the RGAA requires this statement.",
    "accessibility.checks.title": "Checks carried out",
    "accessibility.checks.body": "These checks are not an audit: they are automated checks, run again by the application's end-to-end tests.",
    "accessibility.checks.date": "Date of the latest checks: {date}.",
    "accessibility.checks.method": "Method: {tool} in the Chromium browser (Playwright), WCAG 2.1 level A and AA rules, on {count} screens, in the light theme and in the dark theme.",
    "accessibility.checks.result": "Result: no error of “serious” or “critical” impact on these screens. An automated tool checks only part of the RGAA criteria: this result does not mean compliance.",
    "accessibility.checks.screens": "The {count} screens checked:",
    "accessibility.screen.home": "the home page, with the presentation of GTFS Express;",
    "accessibility.screen.modify": "modifying a network: step 1 (Network and documents) and step 3 (Change) before any operation, without the assistant;",
    "accessibility.screen.explorer": "the explorer: the overview of a network;",
    "accessibility.screen.statement": "this statement.",
    "accessibility.checks.also": "Also checked automatically: the “Skip to content” link, the regions of the page (header, steps, content, status bar), the title of every page, the focus placed on the step's heading, moving from step to step with the keyboard, and a single announcement per change of the status bar.",
    "accessibility.known.title": "Known non-compliance",
    "accessibility.known.map": "Maps: the map of a network cannot be fully used with the keyboard nor read by screen readers; the “Lines” and “Stops” lists give its content.",
    "accessibility.known.small": "Small screens: below 768 pixels wide, a window recommends a computer and covers the whole application until it is closed; at 320 pixels wide, the header overflows (the theme button goes off the screen) and the display has not been fully checked; steps 3 and 4, with their map and tables, are not adapted to it.",
    "accessibility.known.screenReaders": "Screen readers: the application has not yet been gone through with NVDA nor with VoiceOver.",
    "accessibility.known.untested": "Screens not checked: to modify a network, steps 2 (Contract), 4 (Checks) and 5 (Delivery), the window of an operation and step 3 after an operation; the conversation with the assistant in step 3; the steps of a filled project (a network designed, built or delivered); timetables, shapes, the SQL console, comparison, validation, administration; the page of a share link; the rest of the account (“My data”, the licence); and the documents produced (note, reports).",
    "accessibility.derogation": "No exemption for disproportionate burden is claimed.",
    "accessibility.tech.title": "Technologies used",
    "accessibility.tech.body": "HTML, CSS, JavaScript (React, Material UI, Leaflet) and WAI-ARIA.",
    "accessibility.contact.title": "Feedback and contact",
    "accessibility.contact.body": "If you cannot access a content or a service, report it: we will direct you to an accessible alternative or provide the content in another form.",
    "accessibility.contact.subject": "Accessibility of GTFS Express",
    "accessibility.contact.server": "Write to the team of this server",
    "accessibility.contact.none": "The operator of this server has not given an accessibility address: contact the organisation that gave you access to GTFS Express.",
    "accessibility.remedy.title": "Remedies",
    "accessibility.remedy.body": "If you reported to us an accessibility defect that prevents you from accessing a content or a service and did not get a satisfactory answer, you can refer the matter to the Défenseur des droits (the French rights ombudsman):",
    "accessibility.remedy.form": "through the Défenseur des droits' online form;",
    "accessibility.remedy.delegate": "by contacting the Défenseur des droits' delegate in your region;",
    "accessibility.remedy.mail": "by post, free of charge and without a stamp: Défenseur des droits, Libre réponse 71120, 75342 Paris CEDEX 07.",
    "accessibility.established": "Statement written on {date}.",
