    "transform.op.build_timetable.help": "Builds exactly the trips an offer order states for one line, one direction and one day type (first and last departures and headway by band, departures, or a full timetable) on the existing stop patterns, in place of the direction's trips on the chosen dates. Asks what the order does not say: the stop pattern, the running times, the dates without service, the other patterns.",
